'''January Gauntlet II''' (続・1月強襲！, ''Zoku・1 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''Continued・January Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during January and was added in the [[Version 11.0 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Another New Year (Monthly Event)|Another New Year]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
January Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Another Year Lvs''' (あけてました Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of an Another Year Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[January Gauntlet II/Another Year Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*January Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Another New Year (Monthly Event)|Another New Year]].

